config BR2_PACKAGE_MPS3_DEBUG
	bool "mps3-debug (the on-board GDB server)"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_OPENOCD
	help
	  /usr/bin/mps3-debug up|down|status|version: OpenOCD ON the board,
	  as the unprivileged openocd user, remote_bitbang to the harness's
	  own 127.0.0.1:6921, GDB/telnet/Tcl bound to 127.0.0.1 (reached over
	  the claim's SSH). Brings Buildroot's openocd with remote_bitbang
	  and the SoC Labs ahb_qspi + hostio4 drivers (sw/patches/openocd),
	  the target configs (host/openocd) and the design table.
